 '</div><p class="muted small">No 100% complete badge is required. Missing information remains visible and the packet can be updated in dated, reversible releases.</p></section>';
 html+='<div class="btnline"><button class="button" id="copylink">Copy packet link</button><button class="button secondary" id="copybrief">Copy plain-language brief</button></div><p class="notice">Source: October 16, 2026 QPueblo Integrated QIFY–QRX controlled registry. This is a review candidate, not the live evidentiary record. The workbook reports 435 assertions still on human-review HOLD. The public interface shows only navigation and qualified context.</p>';
